#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:1
msgid "Linelist"
msgstr "谱线表"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:3
msgid ""
"`linelist` is one of the core inputs for spectral synthesis. It stores "
"the physical parameters of each transition (element/species, wavelength, "
"`log gf`, damping parameters, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"`linelist` 是光谱合成的核心输入之一。它保存了每条跃迁对应的物理参数（元素/物种、波长、`log gf`、阻尼参数等）。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:7
msgid "Getting a Linelist from VALD"
msgstr "从 VALD 获取谱线表"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:9
msgid ""
"PySME is designed to work well with all types of line lists in "
"[VALD](https://vald.astro.uu.se/) database.  A common workflow is:"
msgstr ""
"PySME 的设计目标之一，就是良好支持 [VALD](https://vald.astro.uu.se/) 数据库中的各种谱线表。常见工作流如下："

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:12
msgid "Download a line list from VALD (typically from `extract stellar`)."
msgstr "从 VALD 下载一份谱线表（通常使用 `extract stellar`）。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:13
msgid "Load it in PySME with `ValdFile`."
msgstr "在 PySME 中使用 `ValdFile` 加载它。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:22
msgid "Linelist is essentially a DataFrame"
msgstr "Linelist 本质上是一个 DataFrame"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:24
msgid ""
"Internally, PySME stores `LineList` data in a `pandas.DataFrame` "
"(`sme.linelist._lines`). So you can use DataFrame-style operations "
"directly: filtering, sorting, editing columns, adding flags, and so on."
msgstr ""
"在内部，PySME 将 `LineList` 数据存储为一个 `pandas.DataFrame` "
"（`sme.linelist._lines`）。因此你可以直接使用 DataFrame 风格的操作：筛选、排序、修改列、添加标记等等。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:38
msgid "Short vs Long Format"
msgstr "Short 与 Long 格式"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:40
msgid "VALD provides two line list formats:"
msgstr "VALD 提供两种谱线表格式："

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:42
msgid "short: fewer fields, suitable for LTE."
msgstr "short：字段较少，适合 LTE。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:43
msgid ""
"long: includes additional upper/lower level and quantum-number "
"information."
msgstr "long：包含额外的上下能级及量子数信息。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:45
msgid ""
"If you plan to run NLTE, you should use **VALD long format**. In PySME, "
"NLTE relies on the extra level information available in long format; "
"short format does not provide enough information for that workflow."
msgstr ""
"如果你打算进行 NLTE 计算，应使用 **VALD long format**。在 PySME 中，NLTE 依赖于 long format "
"提供的额外能级信息；short format 不足以支撑这一工作流。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:49
msgid "Line parameters"
msgstr "谱线参数"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:51
msgid "The short format fields are"
msgstr "short format 包含以下字段"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:53
msgid "species"
msgstr "species"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:54
msgid ""
"A string identifier including the element and ionization state or the "
"molecule"
msgstr "包含元素及其电离态，或者分子信息的字符串标识"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:56
msgid "wlcent"
msgstr "wlcent"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:56
msgid "The central wavelength of the line in Angstrom"
msgstr "谱线中心波长，单位为埃"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:57
msgid "gflog"
msgstr "gflog"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:58
msgid ""
"The log of the product of the statistical weight of the lower level and "
"the oscillator strength for the transition."
msgstr "下能级统计权重与该跃迁振子强度乘积的对数。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:60
msgid "excit"
msgstr "excit"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:60
msgid "The excitation energy in the lower level"
msgstr "下能级的激发能"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:61
msgid "ionization"
msgstr "ionization"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:61
msgid "The ionization state of the species, where 1 is neutral"
msgstr "该物种的电离态，其中 1 表示中性态"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:62
msgid "gamrad"
msgstr "gamrad"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:62
msgid "The radiation broadening parameter"
msgstr "辐射展宽参数"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:63
msgid "gamqst"
msgstr "gamqst"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:63
msgid "Stark broadening parameter"
msgstr "Stark 展宽参数"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:64
msgid "gamvw"
msgstr "gamvw"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:64
msgid "van der Waals broadening parameter"
msgstr "van der Waals 展宽参数"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:65
msgid "lande"
msgstr "lande"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:65
msgid "The lande factor"
msgstr "Lande 因子"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:66
msgid "depth"
msgstr "depth"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:66
msgid "An arbitrary depth estimation of the line"
msgstr "谱线深度的一个经验估计值"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:67
msgid "reference"
msgstr "reference"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:67
msgid "A citation where this data came from"
msgstr "该数据来源的引用信息"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:68
msgid "atom_number"
msgstr "atom_number"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:69
msgid "Identifies the species by the atomic number (i.e. the number of protons)"
msgstr "使用原子序数（即质子数）来标识该物种"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:72
msgid "In addition the long format has the following fields"
msgstr "此外，long format 还包含以下字段"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:74
msgid "lande_lower"
msgstr "lande_lower"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:74
msgid "The lower Lande factor"
msgstr "下能级的 Lande 因子"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:75
msgid "lande_upper"
msgstr "lande_upper"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:75
msgid "The upper Lande factor"
msgstr "上能级的 Lande 因子"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:76
msgid "j_lo"
msgstr "j_lo"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:76
msgid "The spin of the lower level"
msgstr "下能级的自旋"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:77
msgid "j_up"
msgstr "j_up"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:77
msgid "The spin of the upper level"
msgstr "上能级的自旋"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:78
msgid "e_upp"
msgstr "e_upp"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:78
msgid "The energy of the upper level"
msgstr "上能级能量"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:79
msgid "term_lower"
msgstr "term_lower"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:79
msgid "The electron configuration of the lower level"
msgstr "下能级的电子组态"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:80
msgid "term_upper"
msgstr "term_upper"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:80
msgid "The electron configuration of the upper level"
msgstr "上能级的电子组态"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:81
msgid "error"
msgstr "error"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:81
msgid "An uncertainty estimate for this linedata"
msgstr "该谱线数据的不确定度估计"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:83
msgid "Runtime columns"
msgstr "运行期列"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:85
msgid "nlte_flag"
msgstr "nlte_flag"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:85
msgid ""
"Per-line NLTE usage flag written after synthesis. See [NLTE flags in line"
" list](../concepts/nlte.md#nlte-flags-in-line-list)."
msgstr ""
"每条谱线对应的 NLTE 使用标记，在合成后写入。详见 [谱线表中的 NLTE 标记]"
"(../concepts/nlte.md#nlte-flags-in-line-list)。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:86
msgid "strong"
msgstr "strong"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:86
msgid "Per-line boolean flag used by dynamic line filtering."
msgstr "每条谱线对应的布尔标记，用于动态谱线筛选。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:87
msgid "central_depth"
msgstr "central_depth"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:87
msgid ""
"Estimated central line depth used for line selection/filtering. See [Line"
" Filtering](../advance/line_filtering.md)."
msgstr ""
"用于谱线选择/筛选的谱线中心深度估计。详见 [谱线筛选](../advance/line_filtering.md)。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:88
msgid "almax_ratio"
msgstr "almax_ratio"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:88
msgid ""
"Estimated line-center opacity-ratio proxy used in ALMAX-based filtering. "
"See [Line Filtering](../advance/line_filtering.md)."
msgstr ""
"用于基于 ALMAX 的筛选中的谱线中心不透明度比值代理估计。详见 [谱线筛选](../advance/line_filtering.md)。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:89
msgid "line_range_s"
msgstr "line_range_s"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:89
msgid ""
"Start wavelength of the estimated line-contribution range. See [Line "
"Filtering](../advance/line_filtering.md)."
msgstr "估计谱线贡献范围的起始波长。详见 [谱线筛选](../advance/line_filtering.md)。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:90
msgid "line_range_e"
msgstr "line_range_e"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:90
msgid ""
"End wavelength of the estimated line-contribution range. See [Line "
"Filtering](../advance/line_filtering.md)."
msgstr "估计谱线贡献范围的结束波长。详见 [谱线筛选](../advance/line_filtering.md)。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:93
msgid "Important Note"
msgstr "重要说明"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:95
msgid ""
"As far as the radiative transfer code is concerned the ionization is "
"defined as part of the species term. I.e. a line with species = \"Fe 2\" "
"will be calculated as ionization = 2. If no number is set within the "
"species field, SME will use an ionization of 1."
msgstr ""
"对于辐射转移代码而言，电离态被视为 `species` 字段的一部分。也就是说，若某条谱线的 `species = \"Fe 2\"`，则会按 "
"`ionization = 2` 来计算。如果 `species` 字段中没有指定数字，SME 会默认使用 `ionization = 1`。"

#: ../../fundamentals/linelist.md:99
msgid ""
"Also atom_number is ignored in the radiative transfer calculations and "
"therefore does not need to be set."
msgstr "此外，`atom_number` 在辐射转移计算中会被忽略，因此不需要设置。"

